{"info":{"name":"BMA-82 Photo Verification (S16)","description":"BMA-82 S16 사진인증 API 검증 컬렉션 (S16 사양서 v1.4, BMA-31 선택 기능, S7-11 미인증 상대 알림).\n\n상태 → 프로필 사진 없이 409 → 다른 사진 422(재촬영, 무제한) → 같은 사진 통과 → 배지(내 정보·S8 프로필·S5/S10 카드·S6 목록) → 미인증 상대 알림 → 사진 교체·삭제 시 인증 해제 순서로 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행한다. 파일 요청은 Working directory 를 backend/docs/postman 으로 두고 sample-profile.png(프로필과 같음 → 통과), sample-other.png(다름 → 실패)를 선택한다. 얼굴 대조는 스텁(app.verification.photo.provider=stub). 촬영 이미지는 서버에 저장되지 않는다(backend/docs/PHOTO_VERIFICATION_API.md 2절).","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. A(남) 가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정을 쓴다. 셀피 파일은 sample-profile.png(프로필과 같음 → 통과), sample-other.png(다름 → 실패)를 고른다.","const t = Date.now();","for (const n of [\"A\",\"B\"]) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"email\"+n, \"photo-\"+n.toLowerCase()+\"-\"+t+\"@bma.test\"); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nick\"+n, \"사진\"+n+(t % 10000)); }"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userA\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"1. A(남) 로그인","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"1. A(남) 프로필","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"nickname\":\"{{nickA}}\",\"birthDate\":\"1995-05-05\",\"genderCode\":\"M\",\"regionCode\":\"SEOUL_GANGNAM\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"2. 사진인증 상태 - 미인증·시도 0","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"verified false, attempts 0, lastResult null\", () => { pm.expect(d.verified).to.eql(false); pm.expect(d.attempts).to.eql(0); pm.expect(d).to.have.property(\"lastResult\", null); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/photo/status","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","photo","status"]}}},{"name":"3. 내 정보 - photoVerified false","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"photoVerified false\", () => pm.expect(d.photoVerified).to.eql(false));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me"]}}},{"name":"4. 프로필(S8-08) - photoVerified false","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"photoVerified false\", () => pm.expect(d.photoVerified).to.eql(false));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"5. 프로필 사진 없이 대조 → 409 VERIFY_010","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 409 VERIFY_010\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(409); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"VERIFY_010\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"formdata","formdata":[{"key":"file","type":"file","src":"sample-profile.png"}]},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/photo","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","photo"]}}},{"name":"6. 프로필 사진 등록 (S3)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"imageId\", pm.response.json().data.imageId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"formdata","formdata":[{"key":"file","type":"file","src":"sample-profile.png"}]},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/image","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","image"]}}},{"name":"7. 다른 사진으로 대조 (S16-04) → 422 VERIFY_011 (S16-04a~d 재촬영)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 422 VERIFY_011\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(422); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"VERIFY_011\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"formdata","formdata":[{"key":"file","type":"file","src":"sample-other.png"}]},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/photo","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","photo"]}}},{"name":"8. 상태 - attempts 1, lastResult FAIL","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"attempts 1, FAIL, verified false\", () => { pm.expect(d.attempts).to.eql(1); pm.expect(d.lastResult).to.eql(\"FAIL\"); pm.expect(d.verified).to.eql(false); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/photo/status","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","photo","status"]}}},{"name":"9. 재시도(무제한) → 다시 422","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 422 VERIFY_011\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(422); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"VERIFY_011\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"formdata","formdata":[{"key":"file","type":"file","src":"sample-other.png"}]},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/photo","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","photo"]}}},{"name":"10. 같은 사진(셀피=프로필) → 200 verified, similarity 100, threshold 80 (S16-05~08)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"verified, 100/80, stub, imageId\", () => { pm.expect(d.verified).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.similarity).to.eql(100); pm.expect(d.threshold).to.eql(80); pm.expect(d.provider).to.eql(\"stub\"); pm.expect(d.profileImageId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"imageId\")); pm.expect(d.verifiedAt).to.be.a(\"string\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"formdata","formdata":[{"key":"file","type":"file","src":"sample-profile.png"}]},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/photo","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","photo"]}}},{"name":"11. 상태 - verified, attempts 3, PASS","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"verified true, attempts 3, PASS\", () => { pm.expect(d.verified).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.attempts).to.eql(3); pm.expect(d.lastResult).to.eql(\"PASS\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/photo/status","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","photo","status"]}}},{"name":"12. 내 정보 - photoVerified true","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"photoVerified true\", () => pm.expect(d.photoVerified).to.eql(true));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me"]}}},{"name":"13. 프로필(S8-08) - 배지 photoVerified true","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"photoVerified true\", () => pm.expect(d.photoVerified).to.eql(true));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"14. 완료 후 재대조 → 409 VERIFY_012 (S8-17 인증완료)","eve